      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UqizyfkRPv0ZKejByjKPE1EKa3U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240130-scrumptious-salmon-cakes-DDMFS-Step-2-1f68070319264bd2a1d69ecd4ded0493.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240130/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide mixture and shape into 8 equal-sized patties.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ebmq5ZOHR48v2r7CpUlZjNvYNcg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240130-scrumptious-salmon-cakes-DDMFS-Step-3-92a625da1c414ecf9b84293d8f9ed953.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240130/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat enough olive oil in a large skillet to cover the cooking surface over medium heat. Fry salmon patties in batches until browned, 5 to 7 minutes per side. Repeat with more olive oil as needed.",
